  "description": "This bright and airy studio apartment is located on the 4th floor (with lift) of a beautiful, white stucco fronted period building. Onslow Gardens is a highly sought after location and the apartment benefits from a lovely private roof terrace and ample built in storage. The building further benefits from a porter and communal garden access.<br /><br />Accommodation comprises bedroom/reception room, kitchen, bathroom, roof terrace, lift, porter and communal garden access.<br /><br />Approximately 319 sq. ft. (29.6 sq. m)<br /><br />EPC: D<br /><br />Available to rent unfurnished through Knight Frank South Kensington<p><br />Onslow Gardens is a classic South Kensington garden square and offers convenient access to the many excellent shops and eateries in South Kensington. The nearest underground stations are South Kensington and Gloucester Road for the Piccadilly, District and Circle lines. Those travelling by car will benefit from rapid routes to the West and Heathrow Airport via the M4.</p>",
